  "summary": ".NET decoder for DICOM images. VintaSoft DICOM .NET Plug-in is the add-on for VintaSoft Imaging .NET SDK, which allows to decode DICOM images in .NET. Decode DICOM image stored in a multi-frame DICOM file or DICOM directory. Apply VOI LUT (value of interest lookup table) to a DICOM image. Read all patient metadata from the DICOM file with support for ANSI and Unicode symbols. Edit metadata of DICOM file.",
